{"step_index":10733,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-26T13:54:13Z","thinking":"The initial checks on `/monitor` and `/chart.min.js` confirmed basic functionality. The UI specification from \"Iraq Bhai\" clearly outlines preserving the existing display structure for a specific URL and file explorer, introducing only two buttons within the Windows 11 Home environment. Now clarifying that the new buttons will link to and present the content of these 3 locations.\n\n\nThe Windows 11 Home UI requires a minimalist header with two buttons, one for the File Explorer, and another to embed the live resource monitor through an iframe. These buttons enable seamless switching between the file explorer and the resource monitor views. The file explorer view presents the existing file structure, including all drives, whereas the second button displays the exact live resource monitor content.\n\n\nTwo prominent buttons within the Windows 11 Home UI header will provide access to the file explorer and resource monitor, respectively. The second button will feature a real-time CPU percentage display. After confirmation of the file explorer and iframe monitor functionality, the focus shifts to creating a simple and clutter-free implementation within the HTML structure.\n\n\nThe HTML structure, with `showView()` function, controls content visibility based on button clicks. The File Explorer view and the monitor iframe have independent visibility controls. The monitor iframe is configured to load the content from the specified URL and fill the entire viewport. The display logic appears sound.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"bn\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no\">\n  <title>Windows 11 Home · This PC & CPU Monitor (Azure VM)</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Segoe+UI:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --bg-base: #202020;\n      --bg-surface: #2b2b2b;\n      --bg-sidebar: #1f1f1f;\n      --bg-header: #1c1c1c;\n      --bg-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      --bg-selected: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      --text-main: #f3f3f3;\n      --text-muted: #a0a0a0;\n      --accent-blue: #60cdff;\n      --accent-fill: #005fb8;\n      --progress-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      --radius-sm: 4px;\n      --radius-md: 8px;\n      --radius-lg: 12px;\n      --font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, \"Noto Sans Bengali\", sans-serif;\n      --green: #2ea043;\n      --yellow: #f0883e;\n      --red: #f85149;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      user-select: none;\n      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: var(--font-family);\n      background: #0f0f14;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .win11-window {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      height: 100vh;\n      background: var(--bg-base);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n    }\n\n    /* Windows 11 Title Bar */\n    .title-bar {\n      height: 44px;\n      background: var(--bg-header);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 12px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .title-left {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 12px;\n      flex: 1;\n      overflow-x: auto;\n    }\n\n    .brand-logo {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      color: #fff;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    /* 2 PRIMARY BUTTONS IN WINDOWS 11 HOME */\n    .home-buttons-bar {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .home-nav-btn {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      background: #252526;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      padding: 6px 14px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.2s ease;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .home-nav-btn:hover {\n      background: var(--bg-hover);\n      color: #fff;\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n    }\n    .home-nav-btn.active {\n      background: var(--accent-fill);\n      color: #fff;\n      border-color: var(--accent-blue);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 120, 212, 0.4);\n    }\n    .home-nav-btn svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n\n    .pulse-dot {\n      width: 8px;\n      height: 8px;\n      background: var(--green);\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--green);\n      animation: pulse-anim 1.5s infinite;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n    @keyframes pulse-anim {\n      0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n      50% { transform: scale(1.3); opacity: 0.5; }\n      100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n    }\n\n    .live-cpu-pill {\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      padding: 2px 7px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--yellow);\n    }\n\n    .title-controls {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .win-btn {\n      width: 44px;\n      height: 38px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      transition: background 0.15s;\n    }\n    .win-btn:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); color: #fff; }\n    .win-btn.close:hover { background: #e81123; color: #fff; }\n\n    /* Address Bar Area (Visible in File Explorer view) */\n    .address-bar-area {\n      height: 44px;\n      background: var(--bg-header);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 12px;\n      gap: 8px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    }\n\n    .nav-btn {\n      width: 32px;\n      height: 32px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      background: transparent;\n      border: none;\n    }\n    .nav-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { background: var(--bg-hover); }\n    .nav-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.3; cursor: not-allowed; }\n    .nav-btn svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; fill: currentColor; }\n\n    .breadcrumbs-box {\n      flex: 1;\n      height: 32px;\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 8px;\n      gap: 4px;\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .crumb-pill {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      padding: 2px 6px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 4px;\n    }\n    .crumb-pill:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); }\n    .crumb-arrow { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 10px; }\n\n    .search-box {\n      width: 240px;\n      height: 32px;\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 0 10px;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .search-input {\n      background: transparent;\n      border: none;\n      outline: none;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      width: 100%;\n      font-family: inherit;\n    }\n    .search-input::placeholder { color: var(--text-muted); }\n\n    /* Workspace Body */\n    .workspace-body {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: flex;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    /* Left Sidebar */\n    .sidebar {\n      width: 240px;\n      background: var(--bg-sidebar);\n      border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      padding: 8px 6px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    .sidebar-section { margin-bottom: 12px; }\n\n    .sidebar-title {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    }\n\n    .sidebar-item {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: background 0.1s;\n    }\n    .sidebar-item:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); }\n    .sidebar-item.active { background: var(--bg-selected); font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-blue); }\n    .sidebar-item svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n\n    /* Explorer Content Area */\n    .explorer-content-area {\n      flex: 1;\n      background: var(--bg-base);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      padding: 12px 16px;\n    }\n\n    /* This PC Drive Cards */\n    .drives-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));\n      gap: 14px;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .drive-card {\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      padding: 12px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 14px;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: all 0.15s;\n    }\n    .drive-card:hover {\n      background: var(--bg-hover);\n      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\n      transform: translateY(-1px);\n    }\n\n    .drive-icon { width: 44px; height: 44px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n    .drive-details { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }\n    .drive-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-main); }\n\n    .progress-bar-container {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 6px;\n      background: var(--progress-bg);\n      border-radius: 3px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .progress-fill {\n      height: 100%;\n      background: var(--accent-blue);\n      border-radius: 3px;\n    }\n    .progress-fill.warning { background: var(--yellow); }\n    .progress-fill.danger { background: var(--red); }\n\n    .drive-meta { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); }\n\n    .section-header {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n\n    /* File List Table (Details View) */\n    .files-container {\n      flex: 1;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      background: var(--bg-surface);\n    }\n\n    .files-table {\n      width: 100%;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .files-table th {\n      text-align: left;\n      padding: 8px 12px;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      font-weight: 500;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      position: sticky;\n      top: 0;\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n\n    .files-table tr {\n      cursor: pointer;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);\n      transition: background 0.1s;\n    }\n    .files-table tr:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); }\n    .files-table tr.selected { background: var(--bg-selected); }\n\n    .files-table td {\n      padding: 7px 12px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n    }\n\n    .col-name {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    .file-icon { width: 18px; height: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }\n\n    /* Grid View */\n    .files-grid-view {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(110px, 1fr));\n      gap: 12px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      overflow-y: auto;\n      flex: 1;\n    }\n\n    .grid-item {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding: 10px 6px;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      text-align: center;\n      border: 1px solid transparent;\n      transition: all 0.12s;\n    }\n    .grid-item:hover { background: var(--bg-hover); border-color: var(--border-color); }\n    .grid-item.selected { background: var(--bg-selected); border-color: var(--accent-blue); }\n\n    .grid-item .file-icon { width: 44px; height: 44px; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n    .grid-item .item-title {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      word-break: break-all;\n      display: -webkit-box;\n      -webkit-line-clamp: 2;\n      -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      line-height: 1.3;\n    }\n\n    /* FULL EMBEDDED MONITOR VIEW (Exact memories-birth-outer-speeches monitor) */\n    .monitor-view-container {\n      flex: 1;\n      display: none;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      background: #0d1117;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .monitor-iframe {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      border: none;\n      background: #0d1117;\n      display: block;\n    }\n\n    /* Status Bar */\n    .status-bar {\n      height: 26px;\n      background: var(--bg-header);\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 14px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: var(--text-muted);\n      flex-shrink: 0;\n    }\n\n    /* Notepad / Code Preview Modal */\n    .modal-overlay {\n      position: fixed;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      right: 0;\n      bottom: 0;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n      z-index: 1000;\n      display: none;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n    .modal-overlay.active { display: flex; }\n\n    .win11-notepad {\n      width: 900px;\n      max-width: 95vw;\n      height: 600px;\n      max-height: 85vh;\n      background: #1e1e1e;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .notepad-header {\n      height: 38px;\n      background: #252526;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 14px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    }\n\n    .notepad-title {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      color: #fff;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .notepad-body {\n      flex: 1;\n      padding: 12px;\n      overflow: auto;\n      background: #181818;\n      font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1.5;\n      color: #d4d4d4;\n      white-space: pre-wrap;\n      word-break: break-all;\n    }\n\n    .notepad-footer {\n      height: 36px;\n      background: #252526;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      padding: 0 14px;\n    }\n\n    .btn-action {\n      background: var(--accent-fill);\n      color: #fff;\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n      padding: 5px 12px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 500;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .btn-action:hover { background: #0078d4; }\n\n    /* Mobile toggle */\n    .mobile-menu-btn {\n      display: none;\n      background: transparent;\n      border: none;\n      color: #fff;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      padding: 4px;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      .sidebar {\n        position: absolute;\n        top: 0;\n        bottom: 0;\n        left: -260px;\n        z-index: 100;\n        transition: left 0.25s ease;\n      }\n      .sidebar.open { left: 0; }\n      .mobile-menu-btn { display: block; }\n      .search-box { width: 130px; }\n      .home-nav-btn span.btn-label-long { display: none; }\n      .drives-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"win11-window\">\n  <!-- Title Bar with 2 Windows 11 Home Buttons -->\n  <div class=\"title-bar\">\n    <div class=\"title-left\">\n      <button class=\"mobile-menu-btn\" onclick=\"toggleSidebar()\" title=\"Toggle Sidebar\">\n        <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M3 18h18v-2H3v2zm0-5h18v-2H3v2zm0-7v2h18V6H3z\"/></svg>\n      </button>\n\n      <!-- Brand Logo -->\n      <div class=\"brand-logo\" onclick=\"switchHomeTab('explorer')\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\">\n          <rect x=\"4\" y=\"6\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#0078d4\"/>\n          <rect x=\"7\" y=\"9\" width=\"34\" height=\"22\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#1b1b1b\"/>\n          <path d=\"M12 14h10v10H12z\" fill=\"#00adf2\"/>\n          <path d=\"M26 14h10v10H26z\" fill=\"#0078d4\"/>\n          <path d=\"M18 34h12v4H18z\" fill=\"#808080\"/>\n          <path d=\"M14 38h20v3H14z\" fill=\"#a0a0a0\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <span>Windows 11 Home</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- THE 2 PRIMARY BUTTONS REQUESTED -->\n      <div class=\"home-buttons-bar\">\n        <!-- BUTTON 1: This PC (ফাইল এক্সপ্লোরার) -->\n        <button class=\"home-nav-btn active\" id=\"btnTabExplorer\" onclick=\"switchHomeTab('explorer')\" title=\"Windows 11 File Explorer\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#60cdff\"><path d=\"M10 4H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V8c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2h-8l-2-2z\"/></svg>\n          <span>This PC <span class=\"btn-label-long\">(ফাইল এক্সপ্লোরার)</span></span>\n        </button>\n\n        <!-- BUTTON 2: রিসোর্স ও CPU মনিটর -->\n    